{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Jobless Reincarnation\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-11\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A 34-year-old unemployed recluse get hit by a truck... and wakes up as a newborn baby in a fantasy world! With loving parents, a lifetime of regrets, and a beginner's magic textbook, he sets out to make the most of his second chance at life.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/5ff850f37df06.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"無職転生\"},{\"title\":\"Master\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-18\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy begins training with his new magic tutor and learning swordsmanship from his father. He makes rapid progress, but traumatic memories from his past life leave him to afraid to go outside. Is his second chance already doomed to failure?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/6003eda9cbace.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"師匠\"},{\"title\":\"A Friend\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-25\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy begins to explore the village and rescues a green-haired child from a group of bullies. The two grow close practicing magic, but is there more to Rudy's new friend than he thinks?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/600d18dd76299.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"友達\"},{\"title\":\"Emergency Family Meeting\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The Greyrat family is overjoyed when Zenith announces that she's pregnant with a second child, but the mood takes a dour turn when Lilia reveals that she is also pregnant and Paul is the father. Will this be the end of Rudy's happy family?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/60165b05894b2.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"緊急家族会議\"},{\"title\":\"A Young Lady and Violence\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy arrives in the city of Roa, where he's supposed to spend the next five years tutoring the daughter of the local lord. His student, however, is more than he bargained for, and he'll have to fight to start his first ever job, let alone keep it.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/601fc33b063e0.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"お嬢様と暴力\"},{\"title\":\"A Day Off in Roa\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy is officially Eris's tutor, but she doesn't want to learn anything but magic. As Rudy struggles to get her interested in other subjects, he realizes that non-stop lessons are causing her stress and proposes a day off in the city.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/6028b77ee8a4f.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ロアの休日\"},{\"title\":\"What Lies Beyond Effort\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Eris's 10th birthday is fast approaching, and her grandfather has invited nobles from across the kingdom to a dance party to celebrate. There's just one problem: Eris can't dance, and she's quickly losing patience with her lessons.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/60321cc1d4c35.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"努力の先にあるもの\"},{\"title\":\"Turning Point 1\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy reaches his 10th birthday, and Eris and her family plan a surprise party for him. Meanwhile, the strange orb hovering over the city remains a mystery as powerful entities across the world begin to take note of it.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/603b4303a168e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ターニングポイント1\"},{\"title\":\"A Chance Encounter\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudy and Eris find themselves stranded in the wilds of the Demon Continent. Their only chance to survive seems to lie in Ruijerd, a warrior of the infamous Superd tribe of demons, but can he be trusted?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/371310/episodes/604474c1a75d3.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"邂逅\"},{\"title\":\"The Value of a Life and the First Job\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Rudeus, Eris, and Ruijerd make it to a city. They need to earn money for their journey, and decide to register as adventurers, but Superd like Ruijerd aren't allowed inside. Rudeus has a plan, but how well will it hold up in practice?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8145562/screencap/604b2c030e880.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人の命と初仕事\"},{\"title\":\"Children and Warriors\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"With their new money-making scheme in place, Dead End head out to track down a mysterious monster. Unfortunately, the job doesn't go as smoothly as they hope, and Rudy's plans may turn out to be a lot less safe than he thought.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8145563/screencap/6054792c49e40.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"子供と戦士\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}